1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,093
Napoleon led more than a hundred thousand soldiers.

2
00:00:03,393 --> 00:00:05,194
He could not shout orders at each one.

3
00:00:05,694 --> 00:00:07,080
Today, you are the general.

4
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,538
Your soldiers are AI coding agents.

5
00:00:09,838 --> 00:00:12,166
You still shout at each one, step by step.

6
00:00:12,466 --> 00:00:15,981
DeepSeek's team says one person can follow only three to five.

7
00:00:16,931 --> 00:00:20,242
Napoleon's fix was one man: Berthier, his chief of staff.

8
00:00:20,542 --> 00:00:22,037
Napoleon said what he wanted.

9
00:00:22,337 --> 00:00:27,180
Berthier wrote the orders and sent them to the corps: small armies that could each fight alone.

10
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,795
DeepSeek's Super-agent works the same way.

11
00:00:30,095 --> 00:00:33,464
One router agent listens on GitHub and in your team chat.

12
00:00:33,764 --> 00:00:34,454
Ask once.

13
00:00:34,754 --> 00:00:39,917
It opens a ticket and hands it to a worker agent, with its own session and its own folder.

14
00:00:40,217 --> 00:00:41,729
Many workers march at once.

15
00:00:42,229 --> 00:00:43,396
The router stays quiet.

16
00:00:43,696 --> 00:00:47,105
It speaks up only when you must decide, or can use a result.

17
00:00:47,605 --> 00:00:49,224
It is still a research prototype.

18
00:00:49,524 --> 00:00:51,519
But the lesson is two hundred years old.

19
00:00:51,819 --> 00:00:53,581
The limit was never the soldiers.

20
00:00:53,881 --> 00:00:55,477
It was the general's attention.

21
00:00:55,777 --> 00:00:57,179
And now, that general is you.

22
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:59,081
Subscribe for the next one.
